Z||000006||rogergarrison||05-24-2000||08:23 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Fiero-lite:<BR>i got it done about a month ago. i just called my local pontiac dealer and asked if there was an exhaust recall. He took my VIN number and checked, then asked when i wanted to have it done. I had to wait a couple of days for them to get stud replacement kit and manifold. Dropped it off for 2 days. all done and they said the brake cables were replaced at same time too. mine is an 86, dont know about other years. and yes Didnt cost me a dime.<BR>||||reg||1
